WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:12.952
In a home kitchen, the cook mixes flour and lukewarm water in a wooden bowl, then pours in oil.

2
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.399
She kneads the dough with both hands until it forms a smooth ball.

3
00:00:25.596 --> 00:00:29.323
A second splash of oil is pressed and folded into the dough.

4
00:00:42.428 --> 00:00:46.851
The cook cuts the dough into pieces and rolls each into a ball.

5
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.364
A ball is pressed flat and rolled into a long thin oval.

6
00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:09.486
The cook folds the strip into a spiral.

7
00:01:20.828 --> 00:01:24.462
Another strip is rolled long and coiled into a spiral.

8
00:01:30.076 --> 00:01:31.481
The cook covers the bowl.

9
00:01:45.596 --> 00:01:49.114
A floured ball is rolled out into a thin round disc.

10
00:01:52.718 --> 00:01:55.910
The dough is flipped and rolled into a final even circle.
